.gitignore

# Server-specific excludes (mirror of former server/.dockerignore, re-rooted)
logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/lerna-debug.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*

# Diagnostic reports
**/report.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.json

# Runtime data
**/pids
**/*.pid
**/*.seed
**/*.pid.lock

# Coverage
**/lib-cov
**/coverage
**/*.lcov
**/.nyc_output

# Dependency directories
**/node_modules
**/jspm_packages

# TypeScript / tool caches
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.npm
**/.eslintcache
**/.stylelintcache
**/.rpt2_cache
**/.rts2_cache_cjs
**/.rts2_cache_es
**/.rts2_cache_umd
**/.node_repl_history
**/*.tgz
**/.cache
**/.temp
**/.parcel-cache
**/.serverless
**/.dynamodb
**/.tern-port
**/.vscode-test

# Env files
**/.env
**/.env*.local

# TanStack Start build artifacts
**/.nitro
**/.output
**/.tanstack
**/dist